cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PedSimCity, please cite the software and the paper for the part of the model you used."
type: software
title: "PedSimCity: an agent-based model of pedestrian movement in cities"
abstract: >-
  An agent-based model of pedestrian movement across the street network of a city. Agents carry
  cognitive maps of streets, landmarks, districts and barriers and choose routes by distance,
  angular change or urban elements. Modules add a census population and a day of activities,
  lighting-aware walking after dark, and cognitive maps that are learnt and forgotten.
authors:
